\\end{aligned}\n$$\nThe minus sign outside the second blank is supplied. The entries are $\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$ and $\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$, respectively."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186705267 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "22d8dc7e-7dcf-5e87-a514-ba0b51d0b4c9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\sin x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705266} {:answer/id #uuid "58bfdb5e-968c-5d7b-8933-e6f9e29e7127" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sin x-\\cos x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705268} {:answer/id #uuid "bd6e9f4e-127d-5748-8ab4-d59cfe953d8e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sin x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705271} {:answer/id #uuid "eb4c9c8a-21bb-59f1-bf0b-5d73aaf4901c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\cos x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705273} {:answer/id #uuid "ee757f48-1aca-5c61-8e27-727266801bd0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\cos x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705274}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "22d8dc7e-7dcf-5e87-a514-ba0b51d0b4c9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\sin x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705266} :answer-field/id #uuid "1d5f877d-7dd9-5466-a01f-056af56262ad" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705265}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "40160f30-76ff-5ae7-b67f-9d1bec8d54c7" :question/problem "Express $\\sin(x-180^\\circ)$ using $\\sin x$ and $\\cos x$.\n\n$\\sin(x-180^\\circ)=$" :question/worked-solution "Use the difference formula for sine:\n$$\n\\sin(u-v)=\\sin u\\cos v-\\cos u\\sin v.\n$$\nApply it and substitute the exact special-angle values:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sin(x-180^\\circ)&=\\sin x\\cos 180^\\circ-\\cos x\\sin 180^\\circ\\\\\n&=\\sin x\\cdot\\left(-1\\right)-\\cos x\\cdot\\left(0\\right)\\\\\n&=-\\sin x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186705269 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e510cd9f-e377-5b4b-bddf-37a89611e002" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\cos x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705272}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e510cd9f-e377-5b4b-bddf-37a89611e002" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\cos x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705272} :answer-field/id #uuid "acb75aef-34bd-548c-a213-af861944a676" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705270}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "a26c3cda-105b-5298-9e29-d958cb384e3f" :question/problem "Express $\\sin(x-270^\\circ)$ in terms of $\\sin x$ or $\\cos x$.\n\n$\\sin(x-270^\\circ)=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Use the difference formula for sine:\n$$\n\\sin(u-v)=\\sin u\\cos v-\\cos u\\sin v.\n$$\nApply it and substitute the exact special-angle values:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sin(x-270^\\circ)&=\\sin x\\cos 270^\\circ-\\cos x\\sin 270^\\circ\\\\\n&=\\sin x\\cdot\\left(0\\right)-\\cos x\\cdot\\left(-1\\right)\\\\\n&=\\cos x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186705309 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "56f524bb-c860-5cf2-b1d6-bd6e4f478a44" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1+\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705310}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "56f524bb-c860-5cf2-b1d6-bd6e4f478a44" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1+\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705310} :answer-field/id #uuid "23196163-8b50-57d8-8ef1-946e110f34cc" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705307} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "18b743ce-d785-55ea-976a-688873992dda" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{-\\sqrt{2}+\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705305}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "18b743ce-d785-55ea-976a-688873992dda" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{-\\sqrt{2}+\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705305} :answer-field/id #uuid "fb949c8c-5dbd-5371-b74e-f7ad7b8a0806" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705323}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "2f5a97b8-e8e8-53aa-b432-81ebac89487f" :question/problem "Express $\\sin(x+60^\\circ)+\\sin(x+315^\\circ)$ in the form $A\\sin x+B\\cos x$. Enter exact, signed coefficients.\n\n$A=$ {{field-1}}\n\n$B=$ {{field-2}}" :question/worked-solution "Use the sum formula for sine:\n$$\n\\sin(u+v)=\\sin u\\cos v+\\cos u\\sin v.\n$$\nUse the sum formula for sine:\n$$\n\\sin(u+v)=\\sin u\\cos v+\\cos u\\sin v.\n$$\nExpand the two terms separately:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sin(x+60^\\circ)&=\\sin x\\cos 60^\\circ+\\cos x\\sin 60^\\circ\\\\\n&=\\sin x\\cdot\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)+\\cos x\\cdot\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)\\\\\n&=\\frac{1}{2}\\sin x+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\cos x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sin(x+315^\\circ)&=\\sin x\\cos 315^\\circ+\\cos x\\sin 315^\\circ\\\\\n&=\\sin x\\cdot\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)+\\cos x\\cdot\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\\\\n&=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\sin x-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cos x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nLet $E$ denote the original expression. Add the entire second expansion and collect like terms:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nE&=\\left(\\frac{1}{2}+\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\right)\\sin x\\\\\n&\\quad+\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}+\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\right)\\cos x\\\\\n&=\\left(\\frac{1+\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\sin x\\\\\n&\\quad+\\left(\\frac{-\\sqrt{2}+\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)\\cos x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nThus $A=\\frac{1+\\sqrt{2}}{2}$ and $B=\\frac{-\\sqrt{2}+\\sqrt{3}}{2}$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186705311 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bb3e681e-f146-5403-86c9-3c3ae39a3275" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1+\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705318}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bb3e681e-f146-5403-86c9-3c3ae39a3275" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1+\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705318} :answer-field/id #uuid "7f6beff6-c3c0-5947-9a67-005a6225a6c6" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705314} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1fa71734-55a4-5291-8f0b-53456f010da5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705306}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1fa71734-55a4-5291-8f0b-53456f010da5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705306} :answer-field/id #uuid "f80f4b2e-e674-57af-945a-063fe2443b89" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705322}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "6694db47-4d83-5c32-9390-62e96f92a8ce" :question/problem "Express $\\sin(x+45^\\circ)-\\sin(x+330^\\circ)$ in the form $A\\sin x+B\\cos x$. Enter exact, signed coefficients.\n\n$A=$ {{field-1}}\n\n$B=$ {{field-2}}" :question/worked-solution "Use the sum formula for sine:\n$$\n\\sin(u+v)=\\sin u\\cos v+\\cos u\\sin v.\n$$\nUse the sum formula for sine:\n$$\n\\sin(u+v)=\\sin u\\cos v+\\cos u\\sin v.\n$$\nExpand the two terms separately:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sin(x+45^\\circ)&=\\sin x\\cos 45^\\circ+\\cos x\\sin 45^\\circ\\\\\n&=\\sin x\\cdot\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)+\\cos x\\cdot\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\\\\n&=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\sin x+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cos x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sin(x+330^\\circ)&=\\sin x\\cos 330^\\circ+\\cos x\\sin 330^\\circ\\\\\n&=\\sin x\\cdot\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)+\\cos x\\cdot\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\\\\n&=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\sin x-\\frac{1}{2}\\cos x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nLet $E$ denote the original expression. Subtract the entire second expansion and collect like terms:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nE&=\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}-\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)\\right)\\sin x\\\\\n&\\quad+\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}-\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\right)\\cos x\\\\\n&=\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)\\sin x\\\\\n&\\quad+\\left(\\frac{1+\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\cos x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nThus $A=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt{3}}{2}$ and $B=\\frac{1+\\sqrt{2}}{2}$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186705312 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7d3ab39c-8a60-50b1-89e2-8caecd10768d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705313}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7d3ab39c-8a60-50b1-89e2-8caecd10768d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705313} :answer-field/id #uuid "11c7904c-ec7a-5bfc-8a2f-d82452c7105c" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705304} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b5e8f7ba-06b2-5c14-9312-e63156e214ed" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705317}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b5e8f7ba-06b2-5c14-9312-e63156e214ed" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705317} :answer-field/id #uuid "957502ff-e702-5dfa-8a48-df5b9d848595" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705316}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "711dc95a-a8ca-5205-ae27-22364c41033b" :question/problem "Express $\\sin(x-330^\\circ)+\\sin(x+330^\\circ)$ in the form $A\\sin x+B\\cos x$. Enter exact, signed coefficients.\n\n$A=$ {{field-1}}\n\n$B=$ {{field-2}}" :question/worked-solution "Use the difference formula for sine:\n$$\n\\sin(u-v)=\\sin u\\cos v-\\cos u\\sin v.\n$$\nUse the sum formula for sine:\n$$\n\\sin(u+v)=\\sin u\\cos v+\\cos u\\sin v.\n$$\nExpand the two terms separately:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sin(x-330^\\circ)&=\\sin x\\cos 330^\\circ-\\cos x\\sin 330^\\circ\\\\\n&=\\sin x\\cdot\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)-\\cos x\\cdot\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\\\\n&=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\sin x+\\frac{1}{2}\\cos x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sin(x+330^\\circ)&=\\sin x\\cos 330^\\circ+\\cos x\\sin 330^\\circ\\\\\n&=\\sin x\\cdot\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)+\\cos x\\cdot\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\\\\n&=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\sin x-\\frac{1}{2}\\cos x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nLet $E$ denote the original expression. Add the entire second expansion and collect like terms:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nE&=\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}+\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)\\right)\\sin x\\\\\n&\\quad+\\left(\\frac{1}{2}+\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\right)\\cos x\\\\\n&=\\left(\\sqrt{3}\\right)\\sin x\\\\\n&\\quad+\\left(0\\right)\\cos x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nThus $A=\\sqrt{3}$ and $B=0$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186705320 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f137c313-fd40-51e9-90de-4f3ba3b9e24b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705321}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f137c313-fd40-51e9-90de-4f3ba3b9e24b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705321} :answer-field/id #uuid "80d30566-d8bb-54a6-9184-d3afc7580395" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705315} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2f58a23d-e43b-5e8b-9177-3189b8cd2e0a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705308}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2f58a23d-e43b-5e8b-9177-3189b8cd2e0a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705308} :answer-field/id #uuid "c81d787f-06e8-5877-9bec-a6990d883bf8" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186705319}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "ebc66527-3ffa-5a2f-9b76-a34ac24b5bd7" :question/problem "Express $\\sin(x+135^\\circ)+\\sin(x+45^\\circ)$ in the form $A\\sin x+B\\cos x$. Enter exact, signed coefficients.\n\n$A=$ {{field-1}}\n\n$B=$ {{field-2}}" :question/worked-solution "Use the sum formula for sine:\n$$\n\\sin(u+v)=\\sin u\\cos v+\\cos u\\sin v.\n$$\nUse the sum formula for sine:\n$$\n\\sin(u+v)=\\sin u\\cos v+\\cos u\\sin v.\n$$\nExpand the two terms separately:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sin(x+135^\\circ)&=\\sin x\\cos 135^\\circ+\\cos x\\sin 135^\\circ\\\\\n&=\\sin x\\cdot\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)+\\cos x\\cdot\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\\\\n&=-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\sin x+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cos x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sin(x+45^\\circ)&=\\sin x\\cos 45^\\circ+\\cos x\\sin 45^\\circ\\\\\n&=\\sin x\\cdot\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)+\\cos x\\cdot\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\\\\n&=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\sin x+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cos x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nLet $E$ denote the original expression. Add the entire second expansion and collect like terms:\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nE&=\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}+\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\right)\\sin x\\\\\n&\\quad+\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}+\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\right)\\cos x\\\\\n&=\\left(0\\right)\\sin x\\\\\n&\\quad+\\left(\\sqrt{2}\\right)\\cos x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nThus $A=0$ and $B=\\sqrt{2}$."}] :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying Expressions in Degrees Using the Sum and Difference Formulas"}]}
